Add GF(2^64) degree-2 BCH syndrome set reconciliation (merklixsync,
getmerklixbuck, merklixbuck, getshorttx, shorttx), coalesced P2P transaction
burst validation (ProcessRawTxBatch / AcceptMultipleTransactions), BlockSnap
coinbase Merkle branches, and MinedHeader (minedheader / sealedheader /
sealedblock) O(1) header + coinbase relay.
